      },
      "displayName": "Stephen Bayliss",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a4cb543264006867626e",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I've had a report that this seems to fix issues with certain TQL queries (particularly those of the style used by the OAI provider, ie date range queries, where these return large numbers of results).  There've been occasional reports of this on the users list.  These queries were previously generating out of memory errors.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Would be good if we could include the dependency in the POM for the next release.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
